# Discovery Changelog

**Date:** 2026-07-13
**Mode:** Brownfield (post-MVP scope revision following maintainer feedback)
**Previous Version:** v1.0 (2026-07-08)

## Context

After Epic XG1cmts was implemented (PR #3 open, awaiting review), the upstream `sooperset/mcp-atlassian` maintainer raised a token-usage concern about the expanded `DEFAULT_READ_JIRA_FIELDS`. Independently, a code investigation identified a null-filtering bug in the `*all` response path that makes `fields='*all'` actively harmful on Jira instances with many defined custom fields (Archer has 2000+). This session revised the product vision to address both issues before PR #3 merges.

